      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/PhilstarNews/status/2037055486441513293",
      "text": "DINGGIN ANG HINAING!\n\nTransport group PISTON, together with various multi-sectoral organizations, formed the “No to Oil Price Hike” Coalition as they urged more jeepney drivers to join a two-day transport strike along Aurora Boulevard in Quezon City on Thursday.\n\nThe groups called on the national government to scrap the oil deregulation law and remove VAT and excise taxes to help cushion the impact of continued fuel price hikes.\n\n📸 The STAR/ Miguel de Guzman",
