      "url": "https://x.com/PhilstarNews/status/2037057429708693933",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/PhilstarNews/status/2037057429708693933",
      "text": "‘WELGA KAMI’\n\nMembers of transport group MANIBELA hold placards and chant slogans on the first day of a nationwide jeepney strike at their headquarters in Manila on Thursday.\n\nThe group urged the national government to prioritize the removal of excise tax and value-added tax (VAT) on fuel, and to consider repealing the Oil Deregulation Law. It added that around 100,000 transport workers nationwide have joined the ongoing protest.\n\n📸 The STAR/Edd Gumban",
